    },
    {
     "code": "P98",
     "type": "DesignNote",
     "value": "The EWSR1/FLI1 fusion gene is found in 85% of cases of Ewing tumors. In the most common fusion (type 1), exon 7 of the EWSR1 gene is fused in frame to exon 6 of the FLI1 gene; in type 2, EWSR1 exon 7 is fused in frame to FLI1 exon 5. (Atlas of Genetics and Cytogenetics in Oncology and Haematology)"
    },
